<BR>
Just by standing before the door, <STYLE ID="8">Goto-chan</STYLE> seemed to have sensed something.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"This place was off-limits to begin with. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">But there are strangely few old cobwebs on this iron-barred door. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Which means someone went in and out often."</STYLE>
