<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, would you tell us?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　What happened here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... There's still so much I don't understand. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> getting treated as the culprit so often, and every now and then having precognition like </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎うつむき逆.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
