<STYLE ID="11">Dad</STYLE> crouched down and set the flowers before the hole that led to the summit.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then he put his hands together and offered a silent prayer.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... When </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Uncle</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> dragged me here, I was injected with falsificaso, and then Droga. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> injected me with falsificaso again and cured me, but how did </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> know I was here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"............"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> knew </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Uncle</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and the others would come here eventually, didn't you?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　You said you were going around the settlement to thank people for helping put out the fire, and all the while you were hiding here. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">What does it mean?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"............"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, if </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> had spoken up sooner, wouldn't the curse-killing case have been solved years ago?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... Say something..."</STYLE>
