<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎横顔逆.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="11">Kotaro-san</STYLE> opened his eyes and slowly stood up.<PG>
<STYLE ID="11">"I'm proud that everyone in the settlement relies on me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">But... open the lid and this is what's inside. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">I still couldn't accept that </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="11"> was dead, and like a weakling I let </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">'s phantom lead me around."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"So that's how it was. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">were always meeting... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
