<STYLE ID="8">the dead </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> here, weren't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">Yes..."</STYLE><PG>
