{MESON "500"}
―Ten years ago, to treat <STYLE ID="4">Chigaya</STYLE>'s Green-Eye Curse-Killing, I read every book in the storehouse.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I had known about <STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>, and about the Holy Cerejeira Church, for 10 years.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\渓流夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\沈丁花.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="11">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A few days after <STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE> died.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I laid the daphne <STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE> had loved on the riverbank where her body was found.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that moment―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\アポカリプティック.ogg" "SE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "4000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="11">"Wh-what...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That 'Fierce Sound' rang out―<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">..."</STYLE>
{STOPSND "SE2" "5000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The moment I heard that voice, the Fierce Sound and the sound of the stream both faded from my ears.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\和ぴあの２.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="11">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">...!? How..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"I came back through </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s power."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"It can't be...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"But you know, I came back, but I'm not alive again. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">I'm dead, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> regenerated my body."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="11">"Even so, can't you live with everyone again!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"I can't. I can only meet very few people, in very few places. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Really, I shouldn't even be meeting you here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"Then where can we...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"You know the place we made our secret base when we were children?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　At the very back of it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"G-got it...!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\秘密基地奥セピア.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "1"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="11">"There was a place like this here..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"It seems it was made off-limits long ago. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">There's a path here, you see, that leads to the </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"The </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">... You mean </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Yes. So this is an important place. And a place no one will notice."</STYLE><PG>
From then on I met <STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE> here regularly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Without a word even to <STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE>, I alone kept meeting <STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE> in secret.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then, two years after I met <STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE> again, in Shiyo 792―
{PAUSE ""}
it was right after the second curse-killing case.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Curse-killed...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"Yeah. Again this year, someone was killed. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">Nobody says it openly, but it seems everyone thinks I'm bitter about </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">'s death and taking </STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="ふくしゅう">revenge</STYLE><STYLE ID="11"> on the settlement. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">Even though I absolutely didn't do it..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"It really wasn't you who did it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"Of course it wasn't!? Me, do something like that...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Then I'll help, so that you won't be suspected, </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Next year, have everyone keep watch on </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, at your own request. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">If a curse-killing happens during that time, it will be plain that </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'re innocent."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="11">"What do you mean?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">　Don't tell me the curse-killing case... it was </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, you know how </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> lives, don't you?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">―the </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> is afraid of humans. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Afraid they'll lay waste to the </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s land again, like that church did."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Even when she killed the old people and made it look like suicide, the people of the settlement kept stubbornly guarding this place. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">So this time, she decided to kill the people outside the Niimura family, little by little. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">If you don't like it, I'd be grateful if you'd tell everyone to leave here soon..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="11">"I see. Killing alone would only </STYLE><STYLE ID="15" RUBY="あお">stir up</STYLE><STYLE ID="11"> distrust among the residents. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">Then the police―outsiders could come at any time. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">So that was what the old people's suicides were about. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">She wanted to drive the humans out of a settlement where the old killed themselves, but that didn't work either."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Well? Could you tell everyone to leave?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="11">"Handing over your own land with nothing in return isn't something people can easily do. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">Even less so for residents rooted in the land the way Arata's are... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">After all, they didn't run even after being made to witness the old people's suicides."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"You're right... I understand that."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="11">"Besides, if I left here too, I wouldn't be able to see </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="11"> anymore!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"That's true... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">But... every year from now on, it will be painful, you know?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　One resident will die each year."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"It's better than losing </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Also, you remember that promise, don't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"You mean leaving </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">'s green eye as it is?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Yes. You may cure </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"So you still won't tell me the reason?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"I'm sorry..."</STYLE><PG>
I was weak.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Unable to bear the fear that <STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE> would truly vanish, I kept silent, knowing the curse-killings would happen and knowing the culprit.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I knew that leaving <STYLE ID="4">Chigaya</STYLE>'s green eye untreated was dangerous, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As for the storehouse books, there was no telling when someone might catch on, so I thought it best to get rid of the clues.<PG>
But throwing them away would have looked suspicious, so eight years ago, on the pretext of keeping <STYLE ID="4">Chigaya</STYLE>'s Green-Eye Curse-Killing from the residents, I put an electronic lock on the archive room.<PG>
But... 
{PAUSE ""}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "1"}
But yesterday, after I set fire to the storehouse, I finally realized.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, I should say I woke up.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\死神軍団武器.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Already, a number of corpses were walking through Arata.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What I had been trying to hide, <STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> no longer even meant to hide.<PG>
In other words, <STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE> meeting me had not been <STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE>'s will, but <STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>'s.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even though I had known... 
{PAUSE ""}
Even though, somewhere in my heart, I had known it was <STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>'s doing.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地奥2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
That was why I hid here last night.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They were bound to come through here, taking everyone to <STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
